  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two isolated point charges, X of charge <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+Q\"></span> and Y of charge <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+2Q\"></span>, are separated by a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3d\"></span>. P is a point <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span> from X and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2d\"></span> from Y respectively.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the net electric field strength at P?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{kQ}{2d^{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3kQ}{4d^{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3kQ}{2d^{2}}\"></span></li></ol>"
